  "body": "I tried regenerating longtasks on bikeshed and found that there are a couple of conflicting dfns:\r\n\r\n- **event loop**: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop vs https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-agent-event-loop. This one can be distinguished in bikeshed (`for:/` vs `for:agent`). But given that there had been a single `event loop` definition for a long time and many specs use it, I would encourage rethinking the ambiguity introduced here.\r\n- **browsing context**: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#browsing-context vs https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigation-params-browsing-context and they are not distinguishable in bikeshed. Other than adding the relevant information to note that the latter is specific to navigation params, it may also be worth rethinking duplicating the name with a widely used and long-time unambiguous concept.",
